Note on Header SPDX Tags
------------------------
When `idf-zh apply` patches headers locally in a user's ESP-IDF installation,
all original `SPDX-FileCopyrightText` and `SPDX-License-Identifier` headers in
every `.h` file are strictly preserved untouched.
